@startuml
title Cache-Aside: Чтение списка новых заказов (дашборд MES)

actor "Оператор" as Operator
participant "MES SPA\n(React)" as Frontend
participant "MES API\n(C#)" as API
database "Redis\n(Cache)" as Cache
database "MES DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

Operator -> Frontend: Открывает дашборд\n(фильтр: статус SUBMITTED)
Frontend -> API: GET /api/orders?status=SUBMITTED&page=1&size=20
activate API

API -> Cache: GET dashboard:orders:status:SUBMITTED:page:1
activate Cache
Cache --> API: null (промах кеша)
deactivate Cache

note right of API: Cache Miss

API -> DB: SELECT * FROM orders\nWHERE status = 'SUBMITTED'\nORDER BY created_at DESC\nLIMIT 20 OFFSET 0
activate DB
DB --> API: ResultSet (20 записей)
deactivate DB

API -> Cache: SET dashboard:orders:status:SUBMITTED:page:1\nTTL = 30 seconds
activate Cache
Cache --> API: OK
deactivate Cache

note right of API: Сохраняем в кеш\nна 30 секунд

API --> Frontend: 200 OK, JSON с заказами
deactivate API
Frontend --> Operator: Отображает список заказов
@enduml